# MCP servers this repo uses, one per line: <name> [account=<1Password service account>] [KEY=value ...]
# Names come from ~/.os/mcp/registry.json (`os mcp ls`). Values are non-secret literals or
# op://Vault/item/field references, never a secret. KEY is an env var, `${KEY}` placeholder or
# header the registry DECLARES for that server; nothing else is accepted. `os mcp on|off <name>`
# edits this file and re-renders .mcp.json, .codex/config.toml and opencode.json.
# context7 and exa are always on and need no line.
